cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Unrestricted Chow–Liu Tree Selection for Mixed Discrete–Continuous Data"
abstract: >
  Reproduction code for "A Note on Unrestricted Chow–Liu Tree Selection
  for Mixed Discrete–Continuous Data". The repository implements the
  unrestricted Chow–Liu maximum-spanning-tree procedure together with the
  Edwards-restricted baseline, the MDL-discretisation comparator, and all
  experiments reported in Sections 4.1–4.10 of the paper.
authors:
  - family-names: "Anonymous"
    given-names: "Author"
keywords:
  - Chow–Liu algorithm
  - mixed graphical models
  - mutual information
  - structure learning
  - conditional Gaussian model
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-01-01"
version: "1.0.0"
